# Start a pick's capture and perception before its PickObject goal (while the
# task-pose preparation runs). Fire and forget.
# Identity: the result belongs to dispatch_binding.root_task_id and target_query;
# a goal of another root task or target never uses it.
# Clock: the capture is stamped in the ROS clock domain (image time); its age
# is measured by the pick executor on its own monotonic clock from when the
# capture returned. No monotonic value crosses hosts.
# Invalidation: the goal observes again when the robot's measured posture
# changed since the capture, the capture is older than the executor's limit,
# the ROS clock jumped back, or another prefetch replaced it.
# container_query, when set, also detects the place's container.
DispatchBinding dispatch_binding
string target_query
string container_query
---
bool accepted
string reason
